@hitchhiker/engine runtime
--------------------------

pdfjs-dist 5.4.530
  Registry: https://www.npmjs.com/package/pdfjs-dist
  Repository: https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js
  License: Apache-2.0
  Confirmed from the registry license field and the installed LICENSE
  (Apache License, Version 2.0, January 2004). The package is Mozilla PDF.js.
  Pinned. Used to read PDF text in Node from the legacy build. The worker
  runs in-process. No Poppler binary is required.
  6.4.299 was not installed: its engines field asks for Node >=22.22.3 or
  >=24.15.0, and this repo allows Node >=22.
  Optional dependency @napi-rs/canvas 0.1.100 is MIT.
  Registry: https://www.npmjs.com/package/@napi-rs/canvas
  Repository: https://github.com/Brooooooklyn/canvas
  ingest.ts does not import it. PNG and JPEG sizes are read from the file
  header. The image file is not rewritten.

Gallery shortlist
-----------------

packages/knowledge/galleries/curated.json is an offline pack. Gallery names
are facts about public awards, not a copy of gallery copy. The pack does
not fetch Godly or Awwwards, and it does not assume a Godly API. Site of
the Day is not labeled Site of the Year. A live refresh runs only when a
caller passes a fetcher and a non-empty allow list.

